    "localization": {
      "en": {
        "8e4e10a6c18d4c390c0a29dd": "Listen, is there any chance to work something out with the smugglers for a more convenient way to reach the ship?",
        "6e825f2498c5ad44a9ca6a94": "Something wrong with the hovercraft we arranged for you?",
        "94746837a85f80fdba38268e": "The pickup point's bad. Too risky.",
        "a891ed97a9e16462852c3db4": "Told you already, they're not exactly fans of your kind...",
        "b9a1786e47ebac11eb5690c0": "I wouldn't be asking if it wasn't important. I'm ready to pay well and put in the work if it makes getting to the icebreaker easier.",
        "b650a9af55982ba8388503dd": "We've got a whole damn icebreaker sitting around now? And Rosatom just decided to leave something that big in Tarkov?",
        "59a4b5677a658fbaa88a1140": "Yeah, but it's a private ship. Nothing to do with the government.",
        "19558361325fc436c5464b21": "Then I'm not asking whose it is. I'd like to stay alive, if you catch my drift.",
        "c8fd653a3169a8d1a9dac372": "So what about transport? Can you find out if there's a better route?",
        "f6dfb5a58b27f64e50d9b21c": "If I were you, I'd drop it right now. They've got some shit going on with those USEC defectors, so they've got zero time for you and your requests.",
        "3cde7199a9fd62014c93088a": "Then maybe I help them deal with those USECs?",
        "d400bfcb7b5e26ab3df346b3": "Even if I pay a lot?",
        "b4bcfd7231ad05a39c75e781": "Hell if I know. If you're that desperate, go help. No one's stopping you.",
        "78c40e44ae074dac12e7695a": "What exactly is going on with the Rogues?",
        "30f0c73136883a00f5783400": "Don't know the details, and I'm not getting into it. Go ask them yourself, they'll shoot you first and ask questions never.",
        "57eb3c167642e8459fe40ece": "Got it. If I thin out some of those Rogues, the smugglers won't mind, right?",
        "346d9b7486b08f6c3dce0cc8": "I already told you, do what you want. I've got enough shit on my plate as it is.",
        "5a18a909bb0c4029d7afc66e": "Alright. I'll come back once I deal with the Rogues.",
        "ad772bba7a93ff3766e6ddc4": "Still working through the Rogues.",
        "d22e0435ff1975a7958c404b": "The Rogues are thinned out. That should buy the smugglers some breathing room.",
        "cffef4041c32303b4f23fdff": "That's a dent in them, alright. I'll pass the word along. They should be a lot more talkative now."
      }
    }
  }
]